POCKETSMART-AI – Your Smart Budget Recommendation Assistant
Project Development Phase

The Project Development Phase focuses on converting the PocketSmart-AI concept into a functional application that can analyze financial data and provide personalized budget recommendations.

🔹 1. Requirement Analysis
Identify the needs of users for managing income and expenses.
Define functional and non-functional requirements.
Identify the required inputs such as income, expenses, savings goals, and spending categories.
🔹 2. System Design
Design the overall application architecture.
Create database structure for storing user and transaction information.
Design user-friendly screens such as Login, Dashboard, Expense Entry, Budget Recommendation, and Goal Tracking.
🔹 3. Front-End Development

Develop the user interface for:

User registration and login
Income and expense entry
Expense categorization
Financial dashboard
Budget recommendations
Savings goals
Alerts and notifications
🔹 4. Back-End Development
Store and manage user financial data.
Process income and expense records.
Calculate spending patterns and remaining balances.
Connect the application interface with the database.
Implement authentication and basic data security.
🔹 5. AI Recommendation Module

The AI module analyzes:

Monthly income
Previous expenses
Spending categories
Savings targets
Recurring expenses

Based on these inputs, PocketSmart-AI generates personalized budget recommendations and saving suggestions.

🔹 6. Integration

Integrate:
Front End + Back End + Database + AI Recommendation Module

This allows users to enter financial information and immediately receive relevant recommendations.

🔹 7. Testing

Test the system for:

Correct expense calculations
Accurate budget recommendations
Login and data validation
Dashboard functionality
Different income and spending scenarios
Error handling
🔹 8. Deployment

After successful testing:

Deploy the application.
Configure the database and server.
Make the system accessible to users.
Monitor performance and fix issues.
Development Workflow

Requirement Analysis → System Design → UI Development → Backend Development → AI Module → Integration → Testing → Deployment

Expected Outcome

The completed PocketSmart-AI application will help users understand their spending habits and receive personalized, data-driven budget recommendations, making everyday money management simpler and more organized.
